  "worked_solution": "The power set of $S,$ denoted $P(S),$ is the set that contains every possible subset of $S,$ including the empty set $\u2205.$\n\nSo, let's list all possible subsets of $S$ using a tree diagram.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14098182/assets/c02cab907b20d7c740c0f31d5474564eb24a43a9b89667d3a0093d8242597405.png)\n\nAccording to our diagram, the subsets of $S$ are\n\n$$\n\u2205={},\\,{a},\\,{b},\\,{a,b}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nP(S)={\u2205,{a},{b},{a,b}}.\n$$",
